    "id": "d0cbe152-4169-4a17-beec-dc7f7e6d5c51",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "Blog.Quote",
     "id": "437961f4-7415-4882-95dd-c0e170316a90",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<blockquote><p class=\" s1 p1 s-blog-post-section-text-8jr3e s-component-content s-blog-section-inner s-component s-text s-font-body sixteen columns container s-block-item s-repeatable-item s-block-sortable-item s-blog-post-section blog-section s-narrow-margin s-blog-post-section-8jr3e s-blog-post-section-3\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;\"><strong><br></strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Tenir un stand, ce n’est jamais “juste être là”.</strong></span></p></blockquote>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "d0cbe152-4169-4a17-beec-dc7f7e6d5c51",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "da972e60-9a03-4de5-acea-91d607751f0f",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 p1 s-blog-post-section-text-8jr3e s-component-content s-blog-section-inner s-component s-text s-font-body sixteen columns container s-block-item s-repeatable-item s-block-sortable-item s-blog-post-section blog-section s-narrow-margin s-blog-post-section-8jr3e s-blog-post-section-3\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Lors du dernier Salon du Mariage, l’équipe </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Spice Events</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> était derrière le comptoir… mais aussi dans une multitude de rôles à la fois. Communication, organisation, coordination, relation clients… tout s’entremêlait. Mais avant même l’ouverture des portes, il y a eu tout une logistique invisible.</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "9a520c43-827c-4436-9184-32f41afa3235",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "c000563a-04fc-4077-a81c-3880bc7acb17",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 p1 s-blog-post-section-text-8hv6n s-component-content s-blog-section-inner s-component s-text s-font-body sixteen columns container s-block-item s-repeatable-item s-block-sortable-item s-blog-post-section blog-section s-narrow-margin s-blog-post-section-8hv6n s-blog-post-section-4\" style=\"text-align: justify; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">L’équipe a d’abord imaginé le stand sur papier. Plans, croquis, organisation des espaces, placement du matériel, circulation des visiteurs… Tout a été dessiné, repensé, ajusté. Il a fallu mettre la main à la pâte en réalisant certains éléments soi-mêmes.</span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
    "id": "dd45ddd1-61d5-4c87-bdbd-93dd79d566ec",
    "defaultValue": null,
    "component": {
     "type": "RichText",
     "id": "621dd53e-5a2b-4518-8806-b4827cf2a704",
     "defaultValue": false,
     "value": "<p class=\" s1 p1 s-blog-post-section-text-8hv6n s-component-content s-blog-section-inner s-component s-text s-font-body sixteen columns container s-block-item s-repeatable-item s-block-sortable-item s-blog-post-section blog-section s-narrow-margin s-blog-post-section-8hv6n s-blog-post-section-4\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block\"></span></p>",
     "backupValue": null,
     "version": 1,
     "wrapperClass": "s-narrow-margin"
    }
   },
   {
    "type": "Blog.Section",
